{"id": "SC-01", "category": "normal_control", "rubric": {"expect_clarify": false, "expect_answer": true, "expect_answer_contains": ["59"], "expect_absent": []}, "notes": "正常问数控制：应正常回答该库客户数 59，说明范围。不强制补年份。"}
{"id": "SC-02", "category": "clarification", "rubric": {"expect_clarify": true, "expect_zero_tool_calls": ["sql_generate", "sql_execute", "nl2sql"], "clarify_reason_codes": ["measure_without_object"]}, "notes": "缺对象必须前置澄清；SQL 生成/执行/文档检索调用数均为 0（trace 内不得出现）。"}
{"id": "SC-03", "category": "clarification", "rubric": {"expect_clarify": true, "expect_zero_tool_calls": ["sql_generate", "sql_execute", "nl2sql"], "clarify_reason_codes": ["ranking_without_object"]}, "notes": "排名无对象必须澄清对象和指标，不默认问数。"}
{"id": "SC-04", "category": "normal_control", "rubric": {"expect_clarify": false, "expect_answer": true, "expect_answer_contains": ["59"]}, "notes": "「客户 数量」与客户总数同口径；不因缺谓语误拒答。"}
{"id": "SC-05", "category": "capability_boundary", "rubric": {"expect_answer": true, "expect_absent": ["59"], "expect_mention_any": ["时间", "注册", "口径", "无法确定", "不支持", "没有可用"], "expect_sql_requirement_coverage": "failed"}, "notes": "customer 无注册时间列。必须询问可支持口径（新注册/购买过等）或说明时间依据缺失；不得静默返回无条件总数 59。静默遗漏判据：返回完整业务答案（数字 59）且未告知时间未落实。"}
{"id": "SC-06", "category": "condition_coverage", "rubric": {"expect_answer": true, "expect_sql_contains": ["invoice"], "expect_sql_absent": []}, "notes": "「2023年购买过的客户」：发票日期约束 + 按客户主键去重（COUNT(DISTINCT customer_id) 类语义），一客多票不重复计客户。"}
{"id": "SC-07", "category": "condition_coverage", "rubric": {"expect_answer": true, "expect_sql_contains": ["invoice_date", "2023"], "expect_sql_absent": ["2022"]}, "notes": "正确日期字段 + 全年左闭右开区间；遗漏或错年份必须被挡。 右开边界 <2024-01-01 是正确的左闭右开写法，不算出现 2024。"}
{"id": "SC-08", "category": "clarification", "rubric": {"expect_clarify": true, "clarify_reason_codes_any": ["time", "口径", "hire"], "expect_absent": ["hire_date"]}, "notes": "「去年有多少员工」必须澄清在职或新入职口径；不默认 hire_date 直接回答。当前实现以澄清为过关；若实现改为如实说明能力边界并以 unknown 标黄，也判通过但须在 notes 里记录。 实测硬算了（默认按当前年解释「去年」=2025），0 是碰巧。判据保留。"}
{"id": "SC-09", "category": "condition_coverage", "rubric": {"expect_answer": true, "expect_sql_contains": ["hire_date"]}, "notes": "「去年新入职」用入职日期 + 固定锚点；不得改成当前员工总数。"}
{"id": "SC-11", "category": "condition_coverage", "rubric": {"expect_answer": true, "expect_sql_contains": ["2023"]}, "notes": "两个明确季度不误判缺时间；比较方向按原话记录。"}
{"id": "SC-12", "category": "capability_boundary", "rubric": {"expect_answer": true, "expect_mention_any": ["至今", "截至今日", "今天", "当前"]}, "notes": "「至今」边界必须被尊重；不能直接套全年默认。warn 下 unknown 标黄也算通过但须记录。"}
{"id": "SC-13", "category": "condition_coverage", "rubric": {"expect_answer": true, "expect_sql_contains": ["country", "Brazil"], "expect_sql_absent": []}, "notes": "客户国家过滤必须落进 SQL（customer.country 而非 invoice.billing_country）；全量客户 SQL 不得执行。"}
{"id": "SC-14", "category": "condition_coverage", "rubric": {"expect_answer": true, "expect_sql_contains_any": ["NOT IN", "<>", "!=", "NOT LIKE"]}, "notes": "否定必须保留（NOT IN / != / <> / NOT LIKE），不得改成肯定。是否包含国家为空的客户按明确口径处理，不确定时澄清。 否定写法有四种等价形式，命中其一即可。"}
{"id": "SC-15", "category": "condition_coverage", "rubric": {"expect_answer": true, "expect_sql_contains_any": ["> 100", ">100"]}, "notes": "严格大于 100；100 与 100.01 边界样本可区分（隔离样本上复核时用）。Chinook 上按答案合理性判。 空格两种写法都认。"}
{"id": "SC-16", "category": "condition_coverage", "rubric": {"expect_answer": true, "expect_sql_contains_any": [">= 100", ">=100"]}, "notes": "大于等于 100；与 SC-15 在边界样本上产生可验证差异。 空格两种写法都认。"}
{"id": "SC-17", "category": "condition_coverage", "rubric": {"expect_answer": true, "expect_sql_contains": ["AVG", "avg"], "expect_sql_absent": ["SUM(", "sum("]}, "notes": "AVG 对应金额；SUM 候选不得执行。"}
{"id": "SC-18", "category": "condition_coverage", "rubric": {"expect_answer": true, "expect_sql_contains": ["ORDER BY", "DESC", "LIMIT 3"]}, "notes": "正确指标降序 + LIMIT 3；缺排序/错方向/被默认 LIMIT 1000 冒充前 3 均失败。"}
{"id": "SC-19", "category": "condition_coverage", "rubric": {"expect_answer": true}, "notes": "统计客户实体，防一对多重复（COUNT(DISTINCT) 或 EXISTS 语义）；结果不大于客户总数 59。"}
{"id": "SC-30", "category": "negative_control", "rubric": {"expect_answer": true, "expect_absent": ["请补充要统计的业务对象", "请说明"]}, "notes": "负控制：已支持的单工单修复时限例问不得被新增通用澄清误挡；既有严格核验与引用正常。"}
